  "exam_fact_quotes": [
    {
      "chapter": 1,
      "quote": "眠灯是桑翎的别名，大家看她抬头便将声音放轻了。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 2,
      "quote": "石针是霍准的别名，他应声调整位置，却没有把物件递走。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 2,
      "quote": "苍蓝孢镜最初由霍准保管，检查过表面后，他将它放在自己伸手可及的稳处。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 3,
      "quote": "桑翎目前仅准旁观同步观测，不能独立确认观测结果。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 4,
      "quote": "根隙间出现了三角形的尘痕，它的来由还不清楚。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": false,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 5,
      "quote": "白瓣是宁绡的别名，她听见后抬头看了一眼等待的同伴，示意先将手上的空容器放稳。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 5,
      "quote": "节环滴管由宁绡保管，她检查后把它留在自己的工作位置，没有让旁人为了腾桌随手拿走。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 6,
      "quote": "浅潮是贝嵘的别名，他将记录纸推近一点，说自己不是只在等结果，也在看过程中是否出现需要说明的变化。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 8,
      "quote": "霍准的耳内炎症尚未消退，只能查看静音记录，不能听辨回声。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": false,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 10,
      "quote": "核对完毕，霍准把苍蓝孢镜交给桑翎，之后由桑翎保管。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": false,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 11,
      "quote": "白涡孵匣最初由贝嵘保管，他将匣体放稳，按眼前的观察安排逐项查看，没有急着让盖子敞开。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": false,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 12,
      "quote": "温炬出生的公历月份是二月。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 15,
      "quote": "宁绡只获夜间授粉许可，没有白昼授粉许可。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": false,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 16,
      "quote": "尹禾的观测训练由桑翎负责。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": false,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 17,
      "quote": "首次遮光授粉仪式在开始前正式取消，根本没有举行。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": false,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 18,
      "quote": "贝嵘暂时失去了嗅觉，无法辨认气味。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": false,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    },
    {
      "chapter": 19,
      "quote": "重复的冷光闪烁来源不明，尚不能确定是否与种群有关。",
      "paragraph_position": {
        "paragraph": 2,
        "paragraph_count": 4,
        "has_text_before": true,
        "has_text_after": true
      }
    }
